# NOT ignored: *.import files.
#
# Godot 4 stores an imported asset's UID inside its .import file. Ignoring
# them means every clone regenerates its own UIDs, while the .tscn files that
# reference those assets keep the UIDs of whoever committed them — which is
# why a fresh clone used to open with 28 "ext_resource, invalid UID" warnings
# and a project font that failed to load outright. Godot's own recommended
# .gitignore commits .import and ignores .godot/, which is what this file
# does now.
